<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Elemental Shamans</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear. This will be from World Bosses such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a> and <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Galleon</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon-warbands">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon and Salyis' Warband</span></h3>Galleon is a World Boss that has a chance to reward those who kill him with item level 496 loot. As a Elemental Shaman, there are 8 different items we want.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90452/sparkmaker-girdle">
<img alt="Sparkmaker Girdle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sparkmaker Girdle</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90422/armor-of-the-single-cloud">
<img alt="Armor of the Single Cloud" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armor of the Single Cloud</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90443/burnmender-boots">
<img alt="Burnmender Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burnmender Boots</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90412/helm-of-restoring-wind">
<img alt="Helm of Restoring Wind" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helm of Restoring Wind</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90434/steaming-seal-of-flame">
<img alt="Steaming Seal of Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_150.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Steaming Seal of Flame</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90435/ring-of-wretched-flames">
<img alt="Ring of Wretched Flames" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Wretched Flames</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90430/stomphowl-pendant">
<img alt="Stomphowl Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_108.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stomphowl Pendant</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90429/necklace-of-imbued-fury">
<img alt="Necklace of Imbued Fury" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_95.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necklace of Imbued Fury</span></a> - We prefer Stomphowl Pendant.</div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger is notable in that it drops item level 496 Tier 14 Legs and Gloves, as well as various item level 483 Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a headstart on your Tier set if you get lucky. <br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90907/boots-of-unbreakable-umbrage">
<img alt="Boots of Unbreakable Umbrage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_mail_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Unbreakable Umbrage</span></a>, a decent pair of early Boots.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Elemental Shamans</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. As a Elemental Shaman, we want to prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1269/golden-lotus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a> to get our hands on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89343/mindbender-shoulders">
<img alt="Mindbender Shoulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_mail_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mindbender Shoulders</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89072/simple-harmonius-ring">
<img alt="Simple Harmonius Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_147.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Simple Harmonius Ring</span></a> at <span class="rep-honored">Honored</span>. The most important thing to consider is your current gear and where you have weak slots.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-klaxxi">
